  "content_id": "16136180",
  "title": "Revolut (via Paybis) Transaction Issues",
  "description": "Why Was My Paybis Transaction Declined When Using Revolut?\nIf your Paybis transaction was declined when using Revolut, it may be due to ba...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My Paybis Transaction Declined When Using Revolut?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your Paybis transaction was declined when using Revolut, it may be due to banking restrictions, verification issues, or internal Revolut security flags. Here’s a quick overview of possible causes and how to resolve them:</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Bank Restrictions:</b> Revolut may block crypto-related transactions depending on the jurisdiction or payment method used</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Insufficient Funds:</b> Your linked Revolut currency account may not have enough balance, even if other accounts do</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> Either your Revolut or Paybis account may be missing KYC or ID verification</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Incorrect Payment Info:</b> Card or transfer details may be outdated or incorrect</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Review:</b> Revolut may flag the transaction as unusual or high-risk</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction Limits:</b> You may have hit Revolut’s or Paybis’s transfer or purchase limits</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Ensure your Revolut account has sufficient funds in the correct currency</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Double-check your card or payment method details in Revolut</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete all verification steps on both Revolut and Paybis</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact Revolut support to confirm they allow crypto purchases with your method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Monitor emails and app notifications for any flags from Paybis or Revolut</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry with a different Revolut currency account or card if needed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://paybis.com/contacts/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"> <b>Contact Paybis Support</b></a><b>: https://paybis.com/contacts/</b></p></li></ol>",
